- `apps/patterns/src/layouts/Base.astro` — accept optional `initialPane` prop; render it as `<script type="application/json" id="initial-pane">`; import the new `stack.css`; mount `<StackManager client:load />` as a sibling of `<AppShell>` (or inside its slot if we keep it within the inset — either way, mounted somewhere it can render panes; the `script` blob lives outside AppShell to survive its `client:only` hydration).
